          72,
          678,
          445.0440000000003,
          40,
        ],
        "page": 1,
      },
      "text": "This is the introduction. Spaced repetition schedules review of material at increasing intervals to strengthen long-term retention, and this document walks through the theory.",
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "hash": "7ae4b757580c191c028b1657cee648a2eed34842446deab467405facffeacdae",
      "id": "id-3",
      "locator": {
        "bbox": [
          72,
          692,
          400.63200000000023,
          40,
        ],
        "page": 2,
      },
      "text": "Retrieval practice — actively recalling an answer rather than re-reading it — produces more durable memories than passive review, a finding replicated across many studies.",
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "hash": "81fe2432f747914a3b360d3d52ca4742a0e968502afaf345b1c55eb11792d07f",
      "id": "id-5",
      "locator": {
        "bbox": [
          72,
          678,
          429.36000000000035,
          40,
        ],
        "page": 3,
      },
      "text": "The FSRS algorithm models memory as two quantities, stability and retrievability, and schedules the next review for whichever moment retrievability crosses a target threshold.",
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "hash": "fc7fe5858e03ff99b00d689f26d7443e7c4559d68f4bb8852f40d6ae082aca00",
      "id": "id-7",
      "locator": {
        "bbox": [
          72,
          692,
          440.16000000000054,
          40,
        ],
        "page": 4,
      },
      "text": "Review logs record every attempt — the card, the grade given, and the interval that had elapsed since the previous review — and this history is what a scheduler is trained on.",
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "hash": "09cd3acdfb61dba906741091a2d73a23e480362cfff523a41bad442219644e4a",
      "id": "id-9",
      "locator": {
        "bbox": [
          72,
          678,
          430.0680000000004,
          40,
        ],
        "page": 5,
      },
      "text": "Combining a transparent scheduler with content generated from the reader's own sources is the central bet this whole project makes, and the rest of the document builds on it.",
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
  ],
